# LogLens Troubleshooting Runbook

## Authentication failed for user
- **Likely cause:** expired password, locked account, or SSO token issue
- **Steps:** confirm the user ID, reset the password or session, retest
- **Escalate if:** multiple users are affected at the same time

## Connection timed out
- **Likely cause:** network latency, firewall or VPN problem, server overload
- **Steps:** ping and DNS check, test without VPN, retry
- **Escalate if:** it fails on more than one network

## PDF processing failed
- **Likely cause:** corrupt or unsupported file, outdated reader version
- **Steps:** try another PDF, update the app, check file permissions
- **Escalate if:** it happens with every file

## License expired
- **Likely cause:** entitlement lapsed or was not renewed
- **Steps:** verify the account entitlement, refresh the license, restart the app
- **Escalate if:** the entitlement shows active but the app still reports expired

## General application exception
- **Likely cause:** unknown, needs more logs
- **Steps:** collect the full log, note the repro steps, check the version
- **Escalate if:** it is reproducible, with the logs attached
